WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:33.900
Hey, by the way...

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:42.150
- ...I was wondering if I should tell you or not.
- What is it?

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:47.950
I think I can tell you now. That's why I will tell you.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.620
I met Quinza.

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:01.580
Turning Point

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:04.230
He came to my hotel secretly...

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:09.610
...worried about you, checking if you weren't hurt.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:15.600
- Really.
- Somand has not been notified of anything.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:19.450
Aren't you going to ask about Quinza?

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.670
Doubt will turn into a never-ending spiral.

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:28.530
Even if I ponder about my brother, there is nothing I can do right now.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:32.420
Lee-Leng tells me to become a good politician...

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.610
...but there is so much that I don't know about.
 I'm ashamed.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:45.060
That's not true. You're so natural right now.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:50.480
If Lee-Leng made you that way, he is indeed amazing.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:54.270
Lee-Leng prides himself as my guardian.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:56.980
He can get quite overbearing.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.440
Do you remember, Kajika?

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:06.600
The proposal I made. I want you to forget about that.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:10.200
- Rumaty.
- In fact, please refuse it.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:14.460
The government vow is absolute.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:19.500
It is effective until you refuse, so...

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.650
What are you saying?

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.390
I walk on thorny roads.

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:31.380
This is my fate, but you have nothing to do with it.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.900
- You think I will just because of that?
- That vow is a burden.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.550
I cannot carry your weight right now.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.640
Don't make me tell you the truth.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:49.820
That's not true. Your eyes...

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.490
...and your hands tell me that it is all lies.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.420
When did you learn to refrain?

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:59.980
Don't make petty lies between us.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.900
- Kajika.
- When I refuse you...

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:06.930
...is the time when one of us has found someone.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:11.450
That's when I will be rejected.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.030
I might be the one to be rejected.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:18.590
I don't think of us more than friends right now...

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:25.150
...but you might fall in love with someone else. I think that is fair.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:31.970
Besides, it's too late. I had a fight with Najayra.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:36.360
A fight? Out of all people, with Najayra?

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:40.340
She was the one who started it.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.030
She's a very obsessive woman.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.800
Rumaty, are you in bad terms with Najayra?

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:50.950
Of course not. She's a snake.

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:53.750
She becomes uncontrollable if she doesn't like something.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.620
Izmal is with Najayra.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:59.360
He believes in her oracle.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:03.060
Rumaty, aren't you afraid of her oracle?

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:07.360
That's silly. The child of the King and a mere shaman.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.030
Which do you think has God's will?

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:16.180
I like that. Peremptory and very like yourself.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.250
Proud you mean?

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:22.390
All I have is this body and my pride.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:27.520
- There will be nothing left, if I let go.
- Good. That's the spirit.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:31.880
Master Kajika, Master Lee-Leng is calling.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:36.980
- Alright. I will be there in a moment.
- I will stay here for a little more.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.890
It is so strange. Talking with Kajika...

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.910
...makes me feel there is nothing to worry about.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.580
But I like Kajika though.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.570
I wonder what kind of love she is talking about.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:02.970
Who's that? He's coming over. Is that the gardener?

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:08.550
No, it's not. Wh, who are you? What are you doing here?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:13.930
I came to watch the sun set. Would you like to join me, Your Highness?

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.690
- You know my name.
- In this mansion...

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:21.290
...this is the place with the most beautiful sunset.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:26.960
The air is very clear today. Surely, I would be able to see a beautiful sunset.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:32.570
- Come on.
- He doesn't look like an assassin.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.590
He smells like upper class.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:40.560
It is the most magnificent show of nature.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.460
Magnificent? The sunset?

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:48.490
- Anything strange about that?
- Speaking of magnificent, I have to say it's the sunrise.

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:51.520
The sunset is just sad.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:56.930
Really? Things have an ending, so we can start.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:59.860
There is no such thing as eternity.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:03.310
That is why, the end is beautiful.

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:08.850
The same as the origin of a country. Don't you agree, Your Highness?

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.430
Who are you?

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:16.940
But, there are a lot of endings.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:21.370
If you change the form, a complete demise might be avoided.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:26.880
Same as Raginei. The fate of the country has not run out yet.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.920
Rumaty, you become the king.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:36.210
- Rumaty.
- There is still time. You will do it.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:41.850
- Rumaty, become the king.
- Father.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.900
How...beautiful.

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:04.500
Rumaty, we were about to go search for you.

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:08.570
Yes. It's also dangerous walking in the mansion by yourself.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.210
Your Highness, did something happen?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.450
I met my father.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:18.580
- Fever?
- Are you drunk?

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:23.160
I'm sober. "Meeting my father" is just a metaphor...

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:26.380
...his voice and his manners were similar.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.430
That guy told me to become the king.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.120
It felt like my father telling me.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:40.240
- Could that be. - Zao...
- Yes. - ...is Harry here?

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:44.700
No...but I can check with the security.

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:53.710
I thought he was staying in Europe this month.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:56.390
He's so whimsical.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:00.750
- Do you also think it's Dad, Lee-Leng?
- Probably.

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:04.290
He went back without seeing his daughter's face?

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:08.810
But, he came just to visit Rumaty.

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:14.540
I was thinking about it for a long time. Could it be...

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:20.600
...that Rumaty is the second one, for my "Husband Hunt?"

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:26.970
Also, this is still pending, but the third...

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.630
...may be Carl.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.880
- Why do you think so?
- Because...

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:38.910
...I wasn't able to take my eyes off from Mustafa, Rumaty, or Carl when I first met them.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.330
I was attracted to them and felt excited.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:46.020
I understood what Dad meant by: "You'll understand when you meet them."

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.140
Indeed, it is true.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.860
So...who are you going to choose?

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:56.810
No. I will not give you to anyone.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:10:01.150
I will not allow that.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:08.540
Dreams are honest.

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:12.840
How pitiful...I'm like a selfish kid.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.180
I thought I was good at giving up.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:19.140
When it comes to Kajika...

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.780
...why am I so impatient.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:26.920
Kajika excludes my presence by instinct.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:30.390
But of course...

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.940
...I'm just a brother to Kajika.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:35.390
I wasn't able to come forth for a long time...

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:39.440
...and acted as a brother. I guess I'm paying the price now.

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:44.470
What will I do when Kajika chooses a different man.

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:50.040
I can feel the "real" me moving.

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:54.850
A mean, arrogant, selfish child.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:59.440
He yearns for Kajika.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:05.140
I don't have confidence. My feelings...how much can I control it?

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:19.130
Master Volkan, a visitor calling himself your friend has arrived.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:25.270
See, that's Eugene De Volkan.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:29.700
- What shall I do?
- I don't mind. Offer them a seat.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.130
We are in the same class as you.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:38.300
My apologies. I do not attend class that often.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:41.840
See? Even if you come, you leave quickly.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:44.960
It's wasteful, especially since you're on an exchange program.

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:47.220
Do you have no interest in college life?

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:51.900
- Or are you going to return to Sorbonne University soon? 
- You know well.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:56.360
Even if I tell them I'm going to return, I think they will refuse.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:59.390
- Is it because of the rumor?
- Rumor?

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:04.800
At Sorbonne University, the female students assaulted each other for you.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.020
Or similarly, two students killed themselves for you.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:11.940
If it's not true, you should deny it.

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:15.250
Indeed, that's quite not true.

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:20.450
The assault was between the student and the professor's wife.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.790
My girlfriend...

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:27.550
...said that I was cheating with the wife...

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.210
...and shot the wife. Luckily, it was a light wound.

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.770
Bu, but that is such a misfortune.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:40.480
- It was her misunderstanding, right? 
- Oh no. I was seeing the wife, too.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:44.300
Back then, I was always going out with 5, 6 women.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:51.030
I am going to leave now, but do you have any other questions?

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.180
N, no more questions.

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.600
One more correction.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:01.030
Two didn't commit suicide. It was three.

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:16.290
Eugene, that rumor...

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:19.180
...it will be three times larger by tomorrow.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.880
Mr. Burnsworth.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:28.450
Since you left the store quickly, I haven't had lunch yet.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:33.580
You've missed your lunch too right? Would you like one?

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.020
I'm sorry, but I don't eat such things.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.180
But of course. I knew you would say that.

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:47.060
Eugene, you will only eat what you deem first class.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:51.040
What are you going to do, if all of them suddenly disappear?

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.710
I will quietly starve.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.200
Hmph, you are such an aristocrat.

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:59.380
Good or bad, you're a relic from the previous period.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:03.910
- Your type are to perish. 
- So bitter.

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:06.520
But, beautiful.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:11.580
All perishing things exude a specific beauty.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:16.010
You are a man made of such beauty.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:19.990
Eugene, do you like Kajika?

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:26.520
Like? It's not that...

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:31.720
...I love Kajika.

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:35.760
She is not just a daughter of some zaibatsu.

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.600
She has a complicated background that you are not aware of.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:42.900
I don't care about that. I...

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.890
...wasn't alive until I met her.

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:51.430
To me, living everyday was just a road one step closer to death.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:55.000
Not seeing anything, not listening, not loving...

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.770
...I was just waiting for the moment of death.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.050
She woke me up...

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:07.300
...and I learned the meaning of life.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:11.340
Kajika is everything that I live for.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:16.060
If she commands me to live, I will. If she commands me to die, I will.

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:20.100
That's what it means for me to love.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.570
Do you want to marry Kajika?

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:27.110
I'm not interested in such formalities.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:31.120
All I want to do is just love her.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:40.040
I would like to meet you again. Having a conversation with you makes me forget about this world.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:44.920
The next time we meet, I shall have something ready for your palate.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.270
I'm not keen on starvation.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:59.320
You are amazing Carl. I cannot win against you.

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.530
You have a better score in golf.

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:07.790
- You have returned so suddenly. 
- Dad was whimsical.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:12.820
- Besides, I had business in New York. 
- By the way, I'm in trouble.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:18.430
The stock I recommended to the investment company is plummeting.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:21.290
I'll lose face, if I don't act.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.840
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:27.030
Carl, please. Any information will do.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:31.070
Charles, the society calls that insider trading.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.560
I have no intention helping criminal activity.

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:38.300
Don't exaggerate. We're from the same prep school, right?

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:43.500
From the beginning, I was against universities operating investments.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:46.360
Besides, you're attending a business school next year right?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.610
Rather than coming up with cheap tricks...

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:55.160
- ...you should concentrate on your studies.
- An able man like you won't understand my frustration.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:58.400
Anyhow, if that's the only business you have, I am going to excuse myself.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:01.620
Wait. That's too cold.

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:06.110
You can't treat me like this.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:13.060
I wonder what your father will think of you, if he finds out our relationship back then.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.770
You think my father will sway with such threats?

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:23.160
All he'll do is to expel me and find a new successor.

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:27.680
And even for me, it is a good chance to part from my father's dominance.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.550
But you won't be able to run away from the scandal.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.730
First, you will be expelled from the upper class...

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.660
...and you should be prepared for your father's retribution.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.560
- It's just a joke.
- Step aside.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:43.220
- Come on.
- Move! Time for goofing around is over!

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:48.700
That's a nice line. I like it.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:50.700
Harry Burnsworth.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:56.090
You over there. Carl is fiercer than his father if he gets angry.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.120
I advise you to leave immediately.

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:06.320
This is a nightmare. Why is my father's sworn enemy here.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:09.250
This is a nice sporting club.

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.910
Expected from an business run by Rosenthal.

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:17.210
But, I advise you to strengthen the admission examination.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.730
You need to block people who use incidents back from high school...

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:23.960
...and demand insider trading.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:29.540
So, what are you going to do?

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:32.690
Well, do you want me to sell it to the media?

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:36.170
Go ahead, if that's what you want. Even if I disappear...

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.360
...Rosenthal would not sway.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:41.840
No, it will not sway. It will collapse.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.550
Mr. Nelson is not interested in a corporate war right now.

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:50.120
He's interested in a political scheme. If you leave...

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:54.230
...Mr. Nelson will be left with people only sucking up to him.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:19:00.690
I'm sorry, but Mr. Nelson is no longer an enemy as an entrepreneur.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:04.200
You are the one now supporting Rosenthal.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:07.890
I need an enemy to heighten myself.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:11.170
I feel that you can become a good enemy.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:16.490
By the way, you like Kajika don't you?

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:21.620
- What are you saying suddenly!?
- Don't be shy.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:26.460
It's your first time liking a girl...err, a human right?

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.550
You understand well.

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.450
Time for goofing around is over.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.400
I'll give her, if you want her.

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:44.170
It is all up to her.

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:55.800
- I'm returning to the office. 
 - She's waiting in the car.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:01.060
Hmmmm, so you found out.

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.800
Hey Dad.

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:06.890
How did you know?

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.150
I found out from your secretary, Ryan.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:14.210
- That man.
- That's a sports club owned by Rosenthal right?

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.730
Your purpose was Carl right.

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:22.080
Before that was Bistro Leon. A restaurant Eugene frequents.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.300
Yesterday, you suddenly came to see Rumaty.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:31.290
Isn't it about time to talk freely about the 3 candidates?

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:35.680
Alright then, I will ask. Who are the 3 you are interested in?

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:40.050
Rumaty Di Raginei. Eugene De Volkan.

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:45.080
- Carl Rosenthal.
- All of them whom I met.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.720
I always thought it was those three.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.840
I was convinced because you made the move.

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:56.480
So? If those were the 3, then who are you going to chose?

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:00.810
That...I don't know.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.690
- That's a problem.
- I like everyone.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:08.520
But, I don't know...

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:12.510
...if that's the "like" you mean.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.190
Shall we walk a little bit?

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:21.270
Kajika, do you remember about your mother?

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:25.660
That's impossible. I was two when mother died.

00:21:26.230 --> 00:21:30.820
Kitty was a police officer dispatched as my bodyguard.

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:33.850
Police officer? I never knew.

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:38.020
Until I met Kitty, I thought going out...

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.380
...with women were some kind of contract.

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:45.120
That's why, if they got in the way of work...

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:47.640
...or when I got bored with them...

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.900
...I broke up with them quickly.

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:54.040
To me, women meant only that much.

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:57.420
But one day, I met Kitty.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:05.640
All my mannerisms did not work with her.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:08.730
She was so different and absurd.

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:12.040
I was overwhelmed by her passion...

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:15.160
...and one day I suddenly realized...

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:19.430
...that I was in love with her.

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:24.810
- Suddenly?
- If you truly love someone...

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:29.560
...you cannot calmly talk about contracts and responsibilities.

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:32.710
Do you think I will ever have such a moment?

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:36.790
I don't know...this is unique to everyone.

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:40.230
But, you are Kitty's daughter.

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:43.450
She was a woman passionate about love.

00:22:44.370 --> 00:22:47.020
You will understand one day.

00:22:47.370 --> 00:22:49.370
Who you love...

00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:53.510
...and you will win them over...

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:56.830
...just like your mother.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
